# BENCH, the speed test: its two showcase tests (ISLAND and CITY), then a
# walk through its other tests.
# Run: --boot off --fps 30 --frames 860
#
# BENCH is the first tile on the home screen: start it. It opens on FILL.
10 press south
11 release south
# 20: left once (the order wraps round): ISLAND at its default MID detail,
#     a figure running round a floating island, camera behind it
20 press left
21 release left
# 20-499: ISLAND runs (past the tower, round towards the arch, a jump
#          onto a purple block)
# 500: left once more: CITY at its default 32 buildings, driving down a
#      street with traffic (a still at 540)
500 press left
501 release left
# 640, 642: right twice, past ISLAND to FILL (the order wraps round)
640 press right
641 release right
642 press right
643 release right
# 660-822: right every 18 frames, through the other tests at their
# default loads:
#   660 TRI 20
#   678 TRI 100
#   696 TRI 400
#   714 VERT
#   732 SCENE 12
#   750 SCENE 32
#   768 SCENE 96
#   786 SEND ROWS
#   804 SEND DOTS
#   822 TRI SPIN
660 press right
661 release right
678 press right
679 release right
696 press right
697 release right
714 press right
715 release right
732 press right
733 release right
750 press right
751 release right
768 press right
769 release right
786 press right
787 release right
804 press right
805 release right
822 press right
823 release right
# 823-859: TRI SPIN goes on
#
# Still: frame 540 (CITY).
